  <div class="ex-header"><span class="ex-tag">Ex 4.1</span><span class="ex-title">Is X₀X₁X₂ a stabilizer?</span></div>
  <div class="ex-body">
    <p>Apply X₀X₁X₂ to the codeword |Ψ⟩ = α|000⟩ + β|111⟩. Does it stabilize |Ψ⟩? (Recall X|0⟩ = |1⟩ and X|1⟩ = |0⟩.)</p>
  </div>
